@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #365579
skinparam LineThickness 1.2
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F1F5FB
skinparam classBorderColor #365579
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F1F5FB
skinparam componentBorderColor #365579
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F1F5FB
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #365579
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #365579
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E8
skinparam noteBorderColor #C39A42
title GoodsHub — Conceptual Class Diagram
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Category <<domain concept>> {
    id : Integer
    name : String
}

class Goods <<domain concept>> {
    id : Integer
    code : String
    name : String
    category_id : Integer
    unit : String
    weight : Real
    description : String
    status : String
    created_at : Timestamp
    updated_at : Timestamp
    photo_filename : String
}

class AuditEntry <<historical record>> {
    id : Integer
    entity_type : String
    entity_id : Integer
    entity_label : String
    action : String
    before_json : String [0..1]
    after_json : String [0..1]
    created_at : Timestamp
}

Category "1" -- "0..*" Goods : classifies

AuditEntry ..> Goods : may describe changes to
AuditEntry ..> Category : may describe changes to

note bottom of Goods
code is unique.
status is active or archived.
photo_filename may be empty.
end note

note bottom of AuditEntry
The dashed dependencies indicate historical references.
entity_type and entity_id identify the subject.
There is no database foreign key to the subject.
History survives deletion of the live record.
end note
@enduml
